      "description": {
        "text": "A jumbo card given with the September 2001 issue of CoroCoro Comic, published on 15 August 2001, as its bottom edge says; its top line calls it the special jumbo card of Celebi: A Timeless Encounter, the fourth Pokémon film, which had opened in Japan on 7 July 2001. Atsuko Nishida's Celebi, named Timeless Celebi, carries CoroCoro's logo in its corner. Its one attack lets each player put any number of Basic Pokémon from their discard pile onto their Bench.\n\nIt is the first of the two J promos, jumbo cards numbered as promos; the second, Latias and Latios 002/J, came the next year.",
